Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: portal
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Open-source localhost tunneling tool with stable custom subdomains
 Portal allows developers to expose local servers to the public internet
 with persistent, user-chosen subdomains, built-in TLS, an in-memory web
 inspector at 127.0.0.1:4040, and custom binary stream multiplexing.
